%###########################################
% Additional parameters for microsimulation with
% external fluctuations
% typical values: Q_acc=0.01..0.1 m^2/s^3, 
%                 varcoeff_s<0.3, invttc_dv=0.2 m/s,
%                 tau_s, tau_dv=20 s
%###########################################
0.01	Q_acc       = fluct. strength (m^2/s^3) of dv/dt=a_det+xi(t) 
0.3	varcoeff_s  = variation coeff (rel stdev) of error for gap estimate
10	tau_s	    = relax time (s) of OU process for d(gap)/gap (DOS)
0.0	invttc_dv   = mean time-to-collision  error of dv estimate
10	tau_dv	    = relaxation time (s) of Wiener process for dv error



